# Devices: each may read/write ONLY its own subtree.
# %u expands to the certificate CN (the device id), so sensor-001 is
# confined to devices/sensor-001/# and cannot touch another device's topics.
pattern readwrite devices/%u/#

# Processor: read-only access across the whole fleet, so it can ingest
# telemetry from every device but cannot publish or impersonate anyone.
user processor
topic read devices/#